### Taxi Booking from Hotel to Glasgow Cathedral (November 11, 2024 at 10:00 AM)

For your taxi from the hotel (or nearby University of Glasgow area) to **Glasgow Cathedral** (Castle Street, Glasgow G4 0QZ), I searched for options on **November 11, 2024, at 10:00 AM**. The route is about 5 km (3 miles) and takes ~18 minutes in normal traffic. Pickup location is set to the recommended hotel's address (Glasgow G12 9BS), but it can be adjusted if you choose a different hotel.

Available taxi options (all via reliable suppliers like Scottish Transfers; prices in USD, ~24-hour cancellation policy, non-refundable after that):

- **Standard (Economy/Sedan – Best for 1-3 people, up to 3 bags)**: $37.74 USD  
